# AUR-style: ignore everything by default, then explicitly allow the files
# that belong in the packaging repo. This keeps build artifacts out of the
# history: src/, pkg/, *.pkg.tar.*, build logs and the git source mirror.
*
!.gitignore
!PKGBUILD
!.SRCINFO
!*.install
!*.patch
!*.diff
!LICENSE
!LICENSES/
!LICENSES/**
!README.md
!REUSE.toml
!.nvchecker.toml
